# ==========================================================
# CELL 10
# ITERATIVE LLM RELATIONSHIP / PREDICATE EXTRACTION
#
# MAIN LOGIC:
#
#   SOURCE DOCUMENT TITLE
#          +
#   ONE TARGET HYPERLINK
#          +
#   SENTENCE CONTAINING TARGET
#          +
#   6-WORD LOCAL CONTEXT
#          ↓
#        LLM
#          ↓
#    ONE PREDICATE
#          ↓
#     ONE RDF TRIPLE
#
#
# IMPORTANT:
#
# If one document contains:
#
#   <Temperature>
#   <Thermo-mechanical analysis>
#   <Thermofluid Systems Global Capability Council>
#   <MTCCM>
#   <TCCM>
#   <Matlab>
#
# The code makes one LLM call for EACH target.
#
# Example:
#
#   <Temperature>
#       ↓
#   LLM CALL 1
#       ↓
#   predicate 1
#
#   <MTCCM>
#       ↓
#   LLM CALL 2
#       ↓
#   predicate 2
#
# NOT one LLM call for all entities.
#
#
# SOURCE:
#   source_title
#
# TARGET:
#   target_title
#
# PREDICATE:
#   generated by LLM
#
# ==========================================================


